  "alt": "A sketched chart of reward per game, from 0 to 500, against training steps, for three seeds of PPO on CartPole. Seed 1 rises early, seed 2 rises late, and seed 3 rises and then dips before recovering. A thick line shows the average of the three, and a shaded band shows the spread from the lowest to the highest run. Caption inside: same settings, very different runs.",
